# Redirects from the retired Squiffy 5 docs site (docs.textadventures.co.uk/squiffy/).
#
# _redirects only matches paths on this Pages project's own hostname, so the
# old site is redirected here by a Cloudflare Redirect Rule on the
# textadventures.co.uk zone. That rule strips the /squiffy prefix and the .html
# suffix, so /squiffy/continue.html arrives here as /continue, and the rules
# below send it on to the page that now covers the topic.
#
# The Spanish pages (*_es) go to the same place as their English twins, since
# the new docs are English only. Old pages whose name is still a page here
# (/attributes, /cli, and /index, which Pages serves as the home page) need no
# rule - a rule would shadow the real page.
#
# Cloudflare Pages silently ignores everything past the first 100 rules in this
# file. scripts/check-redirects.ts (run by `npm run build`) enforces that limit,
# and checks every path in scripts/legacy-docs-paths.txt resolves to a page.

